    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***SPACIOUS FIFTH FLOOR APARTMENT / BEAUTIFUL PARKLAND VIEWS / GATED PRIVATE UNDERGROUND PARKING / LARGE PRIVATE BALCONY / TWO DOUBLE BEDROOMS / MASTER EN-SUITE / BESPOKE STORAGE / BRIGHT & WELL PRESENTED / PRIME NORTHWOOD LOCATION***\r\n\r\nKELLY BRADSHAW are truly delighted to present this wonderful two-bedroom top floor apartment, beautifully positioned within this highly regarded development and enjoying a particularly impressive elevated outlook over the extensive communal parkland and landscaped grounds.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, it is immediately apparent that this is a home that has been thoughtfully cared for, offering bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout with a lovely balance of practicality, comfort and personality.\r\n\r\nThe entrance hallway is bright and welcoming, with excellent storage and a generous sense of space leading through to the principal rooms. The apartment has been cleverly designed to make the most of its position within the development, with large windows drawing in an abundance of natural light and providing wonderful views across the surrounding grounds.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is exceptionally practical and well laid out, with an extensive run of fitted units, generous worktop space and integrated appliances. Finished in a soft neutral palette, it offers everything required for day-to-day living while remaining bright and uncluttered. The kitchen also benefits from excellent storage, making particularly good use of the available space.\r\n\r\nThe living and dining area is a lovely space in which to relax and entertain, with large windows providing a beautiful outlook and creating a strong connection with the greenery beyond. One of the real highlights of the property is the large private balcony, which enjoys a superb elevated position overlooking the communal gardens. It is a wonderful extension of the living space during the warmer months, perfect for morning coffees, outdoor dining, enjoying a drink in the evening or simply sitting out and taking in the peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nFurther down the hallway are two excellent bedrooms, both offering generous proportions and excellent natural light. The principal bedroom is particularly impressive, with a large picture window overlooking the surrounding area, bespoke built-in storage cleverly incorporated around the room and the added benefit of a private en-suite bathroom. The second bedroom is equally versatile and is currently arranged as a comfortable bedroom/home office, making it an ideal space for those working from home, guests or family members.\r\n\r\nThe principal bedroom's en-suite provides an additional level of convenience and privacy, while the apartment also benefits from a stylish and well-maintained main bathroom, complete with full-size bath, overhead shower, wash hand basin and WC, finished in a clean and timeless style.\r\nThroughout the apartment there is a lovely sense of continuity, with warm timber flooring, crisp white walls, thoughtful storage solutions and carefully chosen furnishings creating a home that feels both relaxed and exceptionally well maintained. The generous windows and elevated position ensure that natural light is a particularly strong feature of the property.\r\n\r\nOutside, the apartment enjoys one of the most attractive aspects within the development, with extensive landscaped communal grounds immediately beyond and uninterrupted views across the mature green space. The balcony provides a rare opportunity to enjoy this outlook from the privacy of your own home, while the surrounding gardens offer a wonderful sense of openness and tranquillity.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally impressive. Set within the established Northwood development, the property enjoys a peaceful parkland setting while remaining exceptionally well connected. Residents have easy access to the Northwood Fitness Centre, Crowne Plaza Hotel, Business Campus and Gulliver’s Retail Park, while Dublin City Centre is approximately 5km away. Dublin Airport, the M1, M50 and Port Tunnel are all within easy reach, making this an ideal location for both owner-occupiers and investors.\r\n\r\nThis is a beautifully presented apartment in a particularly enviable position, combining generous accommodation, a fantastic private balcony, superb parkland views and the added benefit of a master en-suite, with all the convenience that Northwood has to offer."
      },
